(c4) PAN[Sing, my tongue, the glorious battle, Sing the last, the dread affray;](d)GE,(e) lin(gh)gua,(hg) glo(h)ri(j)ó(ji)si(hg) (,) 
Praé(i)li(j)um(kl) cer(hg~)tá(j)mi(ih)nis,(h) (:) (z) 
Et[O'er the Cross, the Victor's trophy, ](h) su(hji)per(g) Cru(ge)cis(f) tro(dc)phaé(de)o(efe) (,) 
Dic[Sound the high triumphal lay,](d) tri(dh)úm(hg~)phum(ed) nó(f)bi(ed)lem:(d) (:) (z)
Quá[How, the pains of death enduring, Earth's Redeemer won the day.](h)li(hji)ter(g) Re(ge)dém(f)ptor(dc) or(de)bis(efe) (,) 
Im(d)mo(dh)lá(hg)tus(ed) ví(f)ce(ed)rit.(d) (::)
